SignalStatsPanel.Tests.swift     29 XCTest cases over the SwiftUI-free core (adapter/projection/model/
                                 telemetry/freshness/accessibility).
SignalStatsPanel.strings         P1/S10 catalog: the 9 web-source keys (Signal/Min/Max/Avg/Count/
                                 Stats Summary/No stats available/signalStats.noDataInRange/
                                 signalStats.hideEmpty) + native chrome (noData a11y + freshness/error).

