PARITY MAPPING (web region -> native; every branch reproduced, no scope narrowing)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GlassPanel                 -> TSGlassPanel
DataTable (5 cols)         -> TSDataTable + TSColumn (signal/min/max/avg/count), compact density, sortable
Toggle "Hide empty ({{n}})"-> native Toggle switch, localized %lld count, shown only when emptyCount>0
Skeleton x4 (loading)      -> four-up TSSkeleton grid
FadeIn                     -> TSFadeIn
CHART_COLORS[idx]          -> TSChartPalette.color(at:) (index-stable Okabe-Ito; web Math.max(0,idx)%len)
