renderNumeric NaN/!finite  -> SignalStatsFormat.numericOrDash -> em-dash "—" + aria "No data"
displayStats (selected)    -> SignalStatRows.rows (one row per selected signal, placeholder for gaps)
emptyCount / visibleStats  -> SignalStatRows.emptyCount / .visible (in-view hideEmpty)
"No data in range" subtitle-> empty-row subtitle under the signal name
title ?? t('Stats Summary')-> resolved.titleOverride ?? facade("Stats Summary")
"No stats available"       -> ContentUnavailableView empty state
P4 leaf contract (added,   -> phase loading/empty/error/data + connection live/stale/offline freshness
 like AcDcStatsPanel/0096)    chip + banner + one-shot stale auto-refresh (web leaf has no error/conn axis)

States rendered: loading, empty, error, data, stale, offline (+ selected-with-placeholders). All tested.
